---
title: GHOST — deployment
---
%% Intended design; not runtime evidence
flowchart TD
  Source["Reviewed source and dependency locks"] --> Build["Windows .NET10 build and tests"]
  Build --> Managed["Self-contained win-x64 app folder"]
  Tracker["Pinned tracker interpreter and native wheels"] --> Bundle["Package artifact inventory"]
  Models["Audited model and licenses"] --> Bundle
  Managed --> Bundle
  Bundle --> Hash["Notices SBOM and file hashes"]
  Hash --> Clean["Clean Windows standard user offline test"]
  Clean --> Passed{"Runtime camera cleanup and rollback pass?"}
  Passed -->|No| Repair["Repair artifact and repeat clean test"]
  Repair --> Bundle
  Passed -->|Yes| Candidate["Portable or per-user installer candidate"]
  Candidate --> User["User-local install"]
  User --> Data[("Separate local snapshots and settings")]
  User --> Upgrade{"Upgrade valid?"}
  Upgrade -->|No| Rollback["Previous package and compatible schema backup"]
  Upgrade -->|Yes| Current["Current verified version"]
  User --> Uninstall["Stop children and uninstall; explicit data choice"]
